 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Cursed Transmutation — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to change the properties of larger areas. As an action for 6 cursed energy, you can transmute the ground beneath you in a radius of up to 30 ft in the following ways:<br />\n<strong>Slippery.</strong> You coat the area in a solution, forcing all creatures other than yourself to make a Dexterity saving throw or fall prone.<br />\n<strong>Explosive.</strong> You destabilize the ground by adding protons. As an action on your next turn, you release an explosion forcing all creatures in range (including you) to make a Constitution saving throw. On a failure, a creature takes 4d6 fire damage or half as much on a success. This increases to 6d6 at 11th level and 8d6 at 18th level.<br />\n<strong>Spikey.</strong> You form physical spikes in the area. A creature that walks 5 ft through this area takes 2d4 piercing damage.<br />\n<strong>Shifting.</strong> You form random foot falls and hazards in the area, causing it to become difficult terrain.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
